        ["{F} worked in a shipyard's quality control office, checking other people's ideas.", "{F} studied physics, then accounting, then physics again.", "{F} is known for careful, thorough and not very surprising work.", "{F} built a career on improving last year's designs, by a little."],
        ["{F} left the Navy's research wing for reasons that are sealed.", "{F} published one famous paper, and nothing since.", "{F} works best at night, alone, and on the wrong problem.", "{F} worked on terraforming before racing; the methods carry over less than expected."],
        ["{F} came from a Syndicate design bureau with a name for squeezing out efficiency.", "{F} ran a small lab on a shoestring and still turned out patents.", "{F} has a knack for knowing which experiments are worth running.", "{F} studied under one of the Deep's famous hyperspace theorists, and kept the notes."],
